  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for the Canton Ledger API clients. AddCantonLedgerProblemDetails() answers a LedgerOperationException escaping a minimal-API or MVC endpoint with an RFC 9457 problem+json response: 409 for contention or a consumed contract, 404 for a missing resource, and 202 carrying commandId and updateId for a command that committed whose result could not be read, which the caller must not retry. UseCantonLedgerProblemDetails() does the same as middleware for a host with its own catch-all exception handling, rethrowing every other exception. ProducesLedgerProblems() declares those responses in the OpenAPI document. Depends on Canton.Ledger.Abstractions only, so it works with either transport.",
